  "releaseNotes": "Added\n\t\t* Added check of execution under .NET 10.\n\n\t\tChanged\n\t\t* Updated `NewPlatform.Flexberry.ORM` up to version `8.0.0-beta06`.\n\t\t* Updated `NewPlatform.Flexberry.Security` up to version `4.0.0-beta03`.\n\t\t* Changed constructor of class `Audit` (it needs `IPasswordHasher` and `AuditAgentManagerAdapter` now).\n\t\t* Changed mechanism of work of `AuditSetter.InitAuditService` (it is better to use DI).\n\t\t* Removed some not stored fields of `AuditEntity` and `AuditField`.\n\t\t* [BREAKING CHANGE] Removed logic of forming fields `CreateTime`, `Creator`, `EditTime`, `Editor` of `AuditEntity`.\n\t\t* [BREAKING CHANGE] Removed logic of forming field `Caption` of `AuditField`.",
